{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "package": "openssl",
  "installation_title": "Installation of OpenSSL",
  "contents_title": "Contents of OpenSSL",
  "installed_labels": {
    "programs": "Installed programs",
    "libraries": "Installed libraries",
    "directories": "Installed directories"
  },
  "installation_blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Prepare OpenSSL for compilation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Compile the package:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To test the results, issue:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "By default the test suite uses all available CPU cores. If you want to use less cores, prepend"
        },
        {
          "type": "parameter",
          "text": "HARNESS_JOBS=<N>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "with N replaced by the number of logic CPU cores you want to use."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One test, 30-test_afalg.t, is known to fail if the host kernel does not have"
        },
        {
          "type": "option",
          "text": "CONFIG_CRYPTO_USER_API_SKCIPHER"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "enabled, or does not have any options providing an AES with CBC implementation (for example, the combination of"
        },
        {
          "type": "option",
          "text": "CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "and"
        },
        {
          "type": "option",
          "text": "CONFIG_CRYPTO_CBC"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", or"
        },
        {
          "type": "option",
          "text": "CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_NI_INTEL"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if the CPU supports AES-NI) enabled. If it fails, it can safely be ignored."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Install the package (setting an empty"
        },
        {
          "type": "envar",
          "text": "INSTALL_LIBS"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "prevents the installation of static libraries):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Add the version to the documentation directory name, to be consistent with other packages:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If desired, install some additional documentation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "kind": "note",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You should update OpenSSL when a new version which fixes vulnerabilities is announced. Since OpenSSL 3.0.0, the OpenSSL versioning scheme follows the MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH format. API/ABI compatibility is guaranteed for the same MAJOR version number. Because LFS installs only the shared libraries, there is no need to recompile packages which link to"
            },
            {
              "type": "filename",
              "text": "libcrypto.so"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "or"
            },
            {
              "type": "filename",
              "text": "libssl.so"
            },
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "when upgrading to a version with the same MAJOR version number"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "However, any running programs linked to those libraries need to be stopped and restarted. Read the related entries in"
            },
            {
              "type": "xref",
              "target": "pkgmgmt-upgrade-issues",
              "label": "Upgrade Issues"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "for details."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
